    "content" : "RRS 250 Race, Ethnicity and Power in America (Units: 3) Critical examination of political concepts, processes and constructions of power that center race and ethnicity within a comparative analysis of American ideals, institutions and laws. Includes a study of constitutional issues and state and local governmental processes. Course Attributes:"
  }, {
