      "font size" : 8.0,
      "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
      "content" : "RRS 276 Race, Activism and Climate Justice (Units: 3) Examination of the intersection of race, socio-economics, political ecology and climate change on a global scale; overview of the scientiﬁc evidence for anthropogenic causes and impacts; and exploration of environmental justice, political ecology, disparate impacts on different peoples and activism on global and local levels. Course Attributes:",
      "kids" : [ ]
    } ]
